{"id":"en_one-night-with-my-stepfather","title":"One Night with My Stepfather","titleEn":"One Night with My Stepfather","description":"Stephanie has endured years of abuse and manipulation at the hands of her stepmother Sara. Everything changes when she learns that Damian, with whom she shared a single impulsive night, is in fact Sara's newly wedded husband. Seeing how much her stepmother has invested in this union, Stephanie sets out to win Damian over, using seduction as a weapon for both liberation and payback. Yet the scheme she launched with a cold heart gradually gives way to genuine feelings. Once Sara catches on to what is happening, her fixation grows increasingly unhinged, pulling all three of them toward a devastating conclusion.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/one-night-with-my-stepfather/en_US/20cfac1c42282c79/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/one-night-with-my-stepfather/en_US/20cfac1c42282c79/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Affair","Bitter Love","Family","Forbidden Love","Revenge","Revenge & Satisfying"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dldrg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_one-night-with-my-stepfather_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dldrg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_one-night-with-my-stepfather_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dldrg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_one-night-with-my-stepfather_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dldrg/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_one-night-with-my-stepfather_